BAUX Session Registry Database Service

🚨 DEPRECATED: Functionality moved to bauxd - See docs/BAUX_CONSOLIDATION_PLAN.md

The BAUX session registry maintains a centralized database of tmux session
locations across the BAUX-MESH network. It tracks which sessions are running
on which nodes, enabling seamless session discovery and migration.

Status: DEPRECATED - Use bauxd for new deployments
Features:
- SQLite-based session registry ✅ WORKING
- Node and session tracking ✅ WORKING
- Automatic cleanup of stale sessions ✅ WORKING
- RESTful API integration ready ❌ MOVED TO BAUXD
- Mesh network session discovery ❌ MOVED TO BAUXD

